      "content": "thanks, i'll try the ibuprofen. i'm also thinking of taking some aspirin too just to be safe since it's swelling so much. i just need it to go away by the morning so i can be on my feet for the presentation. that's fine right? i'll just keep it elevated while i sleep.",
